{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Callam Offices (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the structuralist pods of the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Callam_Offices\" title=\"Callam Offices\">Callam Offices</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> are suspended above a floodplain?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Callam_Offices","retrieved":1788599658909},{"title":"Bernhard Luginbühl (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Swiss sculptor <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bernhard_Luginbühl\" title=\"Bernhard Luginbühl\">Bernhard Luginbühl</a></b> made portraits of a butcher and a forester from knives and saws?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bernhard_Luginb%C3%BChl","retrieved":1788599658914},{"title":"National Intelligence Bureau (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Intelligence_Bureau_(Japan)\" title=\"National Intelligence Bureau (Japan)\">National Intelligence Bureau</a></b> was established because of the heightened threat by Chinese and Russian espionage operations in Japan?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Intelligence_Bureau_(Japan)","retrieved":1788599658916},{"title":"The Dark Pictures Anthology: Little Hope (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that, to reflect the witch-trials setting of <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Dark_Pictures_Anthology:_Little_Hope\" title=\"The Dark Pictures Anthology: Little Hope\">The Dark Pictures Anthology: Little Hope</a></b></i>, composer <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jason_Graves\" title=\"Jason Graves\">Jason Graves</a> used out-of-tune instruments?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Dark_Pictures_Anthology:_Little_Hope","retrieved":1788599658917},{"title":"Obinna Ekezie Jr. (Wikipedia — did you know?)",